title: "Lifting-line solver"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "Lifting-line solver for horizontal-axis wind-turbine rotors in Python: horseshoe vortices on the blades, a prescribed helical wake and airfoil polars give spanwise loads, induction factors, thrust and power."
